# Local scratch: one-shot rollout scripts, PR drafts, throwaway probes.
# A one-shot rollout script is correct exactly once, so it does not belong on
# main. Reusable TESTS do — they live in tests/ and CI runs them (see #44);
# excluding them would make the guard's correctness unreproducible by anyone
# but its author, which is the thing this rule was originally, wrongly, used for.
scratchpad/

# Stale leftover from the CI-only code-review-graph build.
.code-review-graph/
